  "details": "please for your iOS version of vrchat enable it to be downloaded on the Mac App Store for apple silicon Macs, the game doesn't even need to be changed because apple silicon Macs can just run iPad apps natively so it should just be one button press and a whole platform gets access to the game. second suggestion is to let Windows on ARM play the game. when I try to open VRChat on a windows on arm device EAC says it wont let me because architecture, windows already has automatic x86-64 to ARM translation, im not sure if there's a option in the EAC settings for the game to allow it to run on ARM devices but if it does that would be great, if not I understand.",
